cmap <Tab> <nextSuggestion>
cmap <Up> <prevSuggestion>
cmap <kClear> <useEnteredData>
cmap <kDown> <nextSuggestion>
cmap <kEnter> <useEnteredData>
cmap <kUp> <prevSuggestion>

smapclear!
smap <C-i> <editWithVim>
smap <C-j> <nextSuggestion>
